D6 green ✓. Now stage F: D7 (min |vx|) + D8 (norm conservation). Add both tests to the suite, verify red, then implement the renormalized paddle bounce:

```js
ball.y = paddle.y - ball.r;
const hit = (ball.x - (paddle.x + paddle.w / 2)) / (paddle.w / 2);
const speed = ballSpeed(state.level);
let vx = speed * 0.6 * hit;
// Dead zone: never bounce straight up (a center hit would give vx = 0 and
// the ball would loop vertically forever).
const minVx = speed * MIN_PADDLE_VX_RATIO;
if (Math.abs(vx) < minVx) vx = minVx * (hit < 0 ? -1 : 1);
// Speed is a property of the level: renormalize vy so |v| == speed.
ball.vx = vx;
ball.vy = -Math.sqrt(Math.max(0, speed * speed - vx * vx));
state.combo = 0;
```

